,"source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#停止了复原。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"84bde9a1a2d9b2fe4229f6875d69b1977d4f4ff6a2a0f7de8f90b9586305348e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcbcf95da63a0e9d9bcd1736cc453fb6f2a34c8312706cdcdae02e765951edaa","logical_entry_identity":"078253bb82fa652cdd04646dd539257fa2db0e7ec2d6fb157f57d300e4ba95e3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"archer","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"弓箭手"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e4d1926fef8e39f94432b8f4733771114d3120041ecf88f6be322df4d9d4336","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcc0a8a5ef9b9f961ce3dcac5ea41665bf0d08de631f7b6bb0551366f71b0750","logical_entry_identity":"3123aa0161e87a6f6cd17a13b620f716ae26e1d43d6b963ae4ad9b7e32bd5716","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"...We are lost. The orcish forces are too great. No matter how many our squad slays, yet more surge from the depths. Where are the cursed creatures coming from?! We have spied their leader, but have had no hope in killing him; he is a beast, a destroyer, burning with fire infernal and ice cruel and chilling. The power these orcs wield now fills me with dread... perhaps they have found new, mighty allies? This news must reach our ruler. My comrades... I am sorry. I will flee once the opportunity arises, but know that your sacrifices will not be in vain. Long may our empire endure.","source_tag":"_t","target":"……我们完了。兽人大军势不可当。无论我们小队杀死多少，都会有更多兽人从深处涌来。这些该死的生物究竟从哪里来的？！\n我们已经窥见他们的首领，却根本没有希望杀死他；他是一头野兽，一个毁灭者，身燃炼狱烈火与残酷刺骨的寒冰。这些兽人如今掌握的力量令我恐惧……或许他们找到了新的强大盟友？这消息必须送到统治者手中。战友们……对不起。我会在机会出现时逃走，但要知道，你们的牺牲绝不会白费。愿帝国长存。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ff302adab8794fefd1e46197e1119d43615fb6ed4da67ae3a5484a71ed7eaf32","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcc1c02597cf5a8f2e0f9a18c21053631bfd0d190c7e7d32afa781b9e1fac08e","logical_entry_identity":"902a929364ec7cf0f2dd2e2293239a888472513ba33e23b361fa411b77d5c5e0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Temporal","source_tag":"_t","target":"时空"}